{"documents":[{"byte_end":314,"byte_start":95,"concept_id":"owner-q34-doc-00","content":"M27 upgrades the current M26 Knowledge Engine into a context-native runtime that can plan context, select capabilities, allocate compute, verify outputs, and learn from traces without weakening deterministic governance.","document_sha256":"044c03b3d8ad38ac0a22a734a2469629c132499cce5c43d49138d703a5ffca1d","passage_id":"D00P000","quote_sha256":"ca7e82aec2070abd82e6342869544a2dce85546ec3fecde19b241ab32a26c48c","section_id":"D00P000","source_id":"owner-q34-doc-00"},{"byte_end":748,"byte_start":552,"concept_id":"owner-q34-doc-00","content":"- a rewrite of M26\n- a generic multi-agent swarm\n- an MCP-first system\n- a Jev-dependent system\n- a LangGraph / Agents SDK wrapper\n- a replacement for Qdrant, R2, citations, ACL, release, or evals","document_sha256":"044c03b3d8ad38ac0a22a734a2469629c132499cce5c43d49138d703a5ffca1d","passage_id":"D00P001","quote_sha256":"0de3fbd17d2e82e90f905bd3d6cd95eed6544cfb6d30a305f54c58e0a1ee7e0e","section_id":"D00P001","source_id":"owner-q34-doc-00"},{"byte_end":1016,"byte_start":875,"concept_id":"owner-q34-doc-00","content":"2. Context & Capability Plane\n   Knowledge\n   Memory\n   Skills\n   Workspace\n   Tools\n   MCP / Native capability transport\n   Context Compiler","document_sha256":"044c03b3d8ad38ac0a22a734a2469629c132499cce5c43d49138d703a5ffca1d","passage_id":"D00P002","quote_sha256":"5945c698e537b27ed75761c909cbeb8bbac6e80ec0ed5ded22759c4c2925cf46","section_id":"D00P002","source_id":"owner-q34-doc-00"},{"byte_end":1129,"byte_start":1018,"concept_id":"owner-q34-doc-00","content":"3. Execution & Governance Plane\n   Harness\n   Policy\n   ACL\n   Verification\n   Tracing\n   Evaluation\n   Release","document_sha256":"044c03b3d8ad38ac0a22a734a2469629c132499cce5c43d49138d703a5ffca1d","passage_id":"D00P003","quote_sha256":"ee1709331a7702278d33b6fd58b982d0eb637170645f01ceac18788c02ccd701","section_id":"D00P003","source_id":"owner-q34-doc-00"},{"byte_end":86,"byte_start":22,"concept_id":"owner-q34-doc-01","content":"Contracts are the first deliverable. Implementations come later.","document_sha256":"6f98ef617f1c1957ccec627aeae0381f9db48dbd763503a818732bbeb1476a02","passage_id":"D01P000","quote_sha256":"e7ff7ede60d3ed135f9e87a37f7f97eca0bd42b13120341537a3a3bdf3e85565","section_id":"D01P000","source_id":"owner-q34-doc-01"},{"byte_end":847,"byte_start":742,"concept_id":"owner-q34-doc-01","content":"Responsible for knowledge retrieval and authoritative source access. Must not own final answer synthesis.","document_sha256":"6f98ef617f1c1957ccec627aeae0381f9db48dbd763503a818732bbeb1476a02","passage_id":"D01P001","quote_sha256":"d3db744ce18e7b6e30a8e677a4a8afa2294b23a94edf8d159b33cd656ffc68bd","section_id":"D01P001","source_id":"owner-q34-doc-01"},{"byte_end":1025,"byte_start":871,"concept_id":"owner-q34-doc-01","content":"Responsible for bounded decisions such as routing, classification, scoring, and compute tier suggestions. Must not own deep synthesis or production truth.","document_sha256":"6f98ef617f1c1957ccec627aeae0381f9db48dbd763503a818732bbeb1476a02","passage_id":"D01P002","quote_sha256":"facc21c1d62f52b3c20e21168cba91e98b0e3a31ba961d5b446a389214fc61d1","section_id":"D01P002","source_id":"owner-q34-doc-01"},{"byte_end":1121,"byte_start":1045,"concept_id":"owner-q34-doc-01","content":"Responsible for capability discovery and invocation. Must not bypass policy.","document_sha256":"6f98ef617f1c1957ccec627aeae0381f9db48dbd763503a818732bbeb1476a02","passage_id":"D01P003","quote_sha256":"a61eadca12dec24c37107ffc01ba4196bd1d32f14844e82bcb59ad0f3d9d67fc","section_id":"D01P003","source_id":"owner-q34-doc-01"},{"byte_end":1298,"byte_start":1215,"concept_id":"owner-q34-doc-01","content":"Responsible for deterministic enforcement. Agent may request. PolicyEngine decides.","document_sha256":"6f98ef617f1c1957ccec627aeae0381f9db48dbd763503a818732bbeb1476a02","passage_id":"D01P004","quote_sha256":"32bc97753829e31d8b847bec92d